cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "jam-actions-v0 — AI Jam Sessions tool-use traces (public subset)"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "mcp-tool-shop-org"
  - family-names: "Krueger"
    given-names: "Bernd"
    affiliation: "piano-midi.de (upstream MIDI arrangements; CC-BY-SA-3.0-DE)"
version: "0.6.0"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: "CC-BY-SA-3.0-DE"
abstract: >-
  57 multi-turn MCP tool-use records grounded in four classical-piano MIDI
  arrangements by Bernd Krueger (piano-midi.de). Version 0.6.0 is a correction
  release: it withdraws 58 records from four songs whose source files were found
  not to come from piano-midi.de and carry no established arrangement licence.
  Every remaining record is byte-identical to version 0.5.0.
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.21313954"
    description: "Version DOI of the prior release, v0.5.0 (2026-07-11); contains withdrawn records"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.20279919"
    description: "Version DOI of v0.4.3 (2026-05-19); contains withdrawn records"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mcp-tool-shop-org/ai-jam-sessions"
keywords:
  - music
  - midi
  - mcp
  - tool-use
  - symbolic-music
